{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670907225389320494","title":"NPU芯片架构工程师","description":"1. 收集并分析典型端侧AI应用场景（如拍照录像、Agent、LLM等）的神经网络模型；\n2. 选取典型端侧AI应用场景进行系统级软硬件联合验证；\n3. 设计轻量化、高能效的NPU微架构，确定计算单元、控制单元、片上缓存等模块的整体架构方案；\n4. 构建指令集及控制机制，支持灵活的操作控制与资源调度方案；\n5. 设计多任务调度机制，支持边缘推理任务的优先级分配与资源共享方案；\n6. 通过架构建模验证分析对应方案的可行性。","requirement":"1. 具备电子工程、计算机体系结构、集成电路设计、人工智能芯片等相关专业硕士/博士学位；\n2. 有扎实的计算机体系结构、数字电路与SoC设计基础，具备端侧AI芯片或NPU相关研究背景者优先；\n3. 具备良好的科研背景与工程实践能力，有国际一流会议或期刊论文发表者优先（如ISCA、HPCA、MICRO、DAC等）；\n4. 能将AI模型映射到硬件架构中，有模型压缩、量化、算子优化经验者优先。\n5. 具备架构建模经验者优先","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786022408214,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7178830559051874412","name":"硬件研发类","en_name":"Hardware R\u0026D","i18n_name":"硬件研发类"},"job_id":"7670907225389156654","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","locatio